Traffic Shaper: CAKE scheduler type, diffserv mode, quantum check.

Made against opnsense/core 26.7; apply with "git apply" or "patch -p1" in
a core checkout. Needs a dnctl and dummynet.ko with CAKE
(opnsense-src-cake.patch).

